    "detailed_description": "<h1>Update Notes</h1><p><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1186270/extras/4f1fe059929efe4f0f4f9525f6b49af5.avif?t=1705740971\" /></div><br><strong>About Ver.1.1.1 Update</strong><br>-Fixed a bug with Steam Cloud support.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1186270/extras/6bb135789aca6e56388d268cadb083dd.avif?t=1705740971\" /></div><br><strong>About Ver.1.1.0 Update</strong><br>-Steam Cloud is now supported.<br>-Fixed stage 4-1 regarding enemy behavior.<br>-Some effects have been updated.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1186270/extras/58555f3c23c1e524e7f89aaf29ceb1d1.avif?t=1705740971\" /></div><br><strong>Ver.1.0.10 update's details</strong><br>-Added explanatory text to the difficulty selection screen and changed the layout.<br>-Adjusted death log performance.<br>-Fixed the behavior of some bosses.<br>-Fixed a bug that prevented the waiting motion of some character skins from occurring.<br>-Fixed minor bugs.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1186270/extras/1e844da90ecdba814ada0f9d769dffa9.avif?t=1705740971\" /></div><br><strong>Ver.1.0.9 update's details</strong><br>-Now compatible with PlayStation 4 controller, PlayStation 5 controller, and Nintendo Switch Pro controller.<br>-When pressing the summon button with a diagonal input that contains an upper element, the summon will now be executed horizontally.<br>-Adjusted the event direction.<br>-Fixed minor bugs.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1186270/extras/dd7e84b1fb8850b0cf77f4746c8869bc.avif?t=1705740971\" /></div><br><strong>Ver.1.0.8 update's details</strong><br>-Added a new skin &quot;Snow Dress&quot;.<br>-Added difficulty levels.<br>-Updated some graphics.<br>-Fixed minor bugs.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1186270/extras/5ff2a86aa2fd3668fe3522c6f0d3b54c.avif?t=1705740971\" /></div><br><strong>Ver.1.0.7 update's details</strong><br>-Added a new skin &quot;Halloween Dress&quot;.<br>-Reduced downward hit collision during a jump.<br>-Fixed a problem with synchronizing save data.<br>-Other minor adjustments were made.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1186270/extras/350b79ab759b8e99fff5de6a4eaea493.avif?t=1705740971\" /></div><br><strong>Ver.1.0.6 update's details</strong><br>-Even you quit the game, your Blood Points will save automatically.<br>-The invincible time, when you use skill \u201cSummon Zasha\u201d now extended.<br>-BGM for each area has been updated.<br>-Fixed minor bugs.<br><br><br><strong>Ver.1.0.5 update's details</strong><br>-Added support for German and French.<br>-Fixed auto-save while stage changing .<br>-Fixed a bug related to the behavior of enemy during stun.<br>-Updated some effects.<br>-Fixed minor bugs.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1186270/extras/6b9a6ddde2d8ef5cbe42e0d0f3aa9ce3.poster.avif?t=1705740971\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1186270/extras/6b9a6ddde2d8ef5cbe42e0d0f3aa9ce3.webm?t=1705740971\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Ver.1.0.4 update's details</strong><br>-Added &quot;Death Log&quot; function to the option.<br>-Updated some BGM.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1186270/extras/92b0c70493b4f13e887beb887dd4a21e.avif?t=1705740971\" /></div><br><br><strong>Ver.1.0.3 update's details</strong><br>-Added new skin &quot;Santa Dress&quot;.<br>-Added support for Spanish (Latin America).<br>-Fixed minor bugs.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1186270/extras/9a82081a8b89060b0dd7c09a21cf5abe.poster.avif?t=1705740971\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1186270/extras/9a82081a8b89060b0dd7c09a21cf5abe.webm?t=1705740971\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Ver.1.0.2 update's details</strong><br>-Added new skin &quot;Uni Akatsuki&quot;.<br>-Added support for Korean language.<br>-Adjusted the difficulty of stage 3-6.<br>-Fixed minor bugs.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1186270/extras/b35d45079476fa63e363e9b23e0d87a0.poster.avif?t=1705740971\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1186270/extras/b35d45079476fa63e363e9b23e0d87a0.apng?t=1705740971\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><br><br><strong>Ver.1.0.1 update's details</strong><br>-Fixed the problem that save data may not be synchronized correctly, during offline operation.<br>-Fixed an issue that effects were not correctly show in high fps output while stage clear.</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>It is cute but extremely hard!!!<br>The immortal girl keeps to be reborn any number of times even if she gets beaten.<br>It is an action game that includes puzzle-like elements by learning the movement and timing of the enemies.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1186270/extras/9b413ebaade2717021088ac1e5205f41.poster.avif?t=1705740971\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1186270/extras/9b413ebaade2717021088ac1e5205f41.webm?t=1705740971\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br><br>Story<br>The habitation was ravaged by Vampire hunters and a Vampire girl named Lilinor traveled with her follower Zasha to find a new castle.<br>After traveling for a while, they found the remains in the depths of the forest off the road.<br>However, the demons already lived there ...<br>\u201cFor now, let's go to the lowest level. we must defeat the big shots and make the hierarchical relationship clear.\u201d",
    "about_the_game": "It is cute but extremely hard!!!<br>The immortal girl keeps to be reborn any number of times even if she gets beaten.<br>It is an action game that includes puzzle-like elements by learning the movement and timing of the enemies.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1186270/extras/9b413ebaade2717021088ac1e5205f41.poster.avif?t=1705740971\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1186270/extras/9b413ebaade2717021088ac1e5205f41.webm?t=1705740971\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br><br>Story<br>The habitation was ravaged by Vampire hunters and a Vampire girl named Lilinor traveled with her follower Zasha to find a new castle.<br>After traveling for a while, they found the remains in the depths of the forest off the road.<br>However, the demons already lived there ...<br>\u201cFor now, let's go to the lowest level. we must defeat the big shots and make the hierarchical relationship clear.\u201d",
